This points to the reason for the "odd" place structure.=A0 If I say {mi si=
sku lo pavelseljirna}, it follows that I am claiming that there is a unicor=
n I am looking for, and hence that there is a unicorn.=A0 Which is not what=
 is intended at all.=A0 So, in this case and a few others (not nearly enoug=
h to prevent problems, but enough to prevent looking for a good general sol=
ution), places were altered to give non-problematic places, at the cost of =
practical usage.=A0 The solution to allow just different kinds of sumti in =
places was never developed as much as it needed to be, although a lot of wo=
rk was done with {djica} a few other problem cases.




