reen thing in my dresser" (mi sisku lo (ka?) crino lo seldacru). =A0But for=
 "I'm looking for my keys", I've either got to spend half the day spelling =
it all out, or I guess selkik's tanru works =A0tolerably=A0well "mi troci c=
o zvafa'i lo mi ckiku"
>
>
>I guess it just seems like an unfortunate definition for sisku given how e=
asy it is to add=A0an object-by-property aspect to the searching. =A0i.e. =
=A0"mi sisku lo creka poi crino" or even "mi sisku lo crino creka".
>
>
>meh, it is what it is.
>
>
